5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick a new service! I want to make sure whatever we choose is really reliable for everyone. Let's make this great!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. I agree that reliability is key, though I suspect the most reliable data often hides in plain sight, waiting for someone to actually read it. I look forward to our deliberation.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep this efficient. I'm interested in seeing if we actually have the capacity to handle a new project without just piling more work onto the same few people. Logic should guide our choice.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Shion. We need a sustainable plan. I want to ensure the financial structure of the expansion is sound so we don't run into shortages halfway through the implementation.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I just want to make sure that... whoever we are trying to help can actually get to us. I don't want anyone to be left out because of where they live.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I totally agree with Daisuke! Accessibility is so important. I'm a bit worried about things falling apart if the situation changes, so I want to check the winter road closures north of the river and bus links.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, Yumi. For my part, I believe we should avoid reinventing the wheel. I shall look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll focus on the human element. I want to see the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. Let's see who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. I want to understand the nature of our funding before we commit.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the winter road closures north of the river. I just want to be sure people can reach us.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"It looks like Daisuke and I are looking into the same things! That's okay, we can compare notes later. I'm really hoping we find a way to keep services steady all year round!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, redundancy in research can be a charming way to ensure accuracy. I shall remain focused on our archives; there is a certain elegance in learning from our own history before leaping into the unknown.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Redundancy is just a waste of time, Benjamin. I'd rather we cover more ground. I'm curious to see if our current staff and volunteers are already stretched to their limits before we add more.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It is better to be thorough than to rush. While we cover different areas, we are all seeking the same goal: a service that is viable and sustainable for the long term.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm sorry if I'm repeating things. I just... I really worry about the people who live far away. I hope the information helps us make a fair choice.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Don't apologize, Daisuke! It's wonderful that you care so much. I think we've all picked some really important things to check. I can't wait to see what we find out! Let's do our best!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us hope that the data provides a clearer mirror than our own assumptions. I shall await the findings with a measured sense of anticipation.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I've made my choices. Let's just hope the results are transparent enough to prevent any naive decisions. I'm ready to move on to the findings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Minako,,I have my selections as well. I believe the data on funding and expenditures will provide the necessary foundation for our decision. I am ready to proceed to the next round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm ready too. I hope I picked the right things to help.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
